  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IDF Grant-Modernization and Capacity Building of Indian C&amp;AG&apos;s Office</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall  objective of the proposed Grant is to assist  the Office of the Comptroller and Auditor General (C&amp;AG)  in its efforts to continuously improve the efficiency and effectiveness of the public audit function in India.  The specific objectives of the Grant are to: (i) develop a well defined strategy (short, medium and long term) for modernizing the institutional capacity of the office of the C&amp;AG, the outcome from which will be the implementation of capacity building activities which demonstrably align with the vision of the Comptroller and Auditor General for the public audit function of India to attain or maintain international best practice across his mandate; and (ii) strengthen the capacity of the staff of the C&amp;AG to exercise higher level audit functions in certain key areas, through specific capacity building activities to be  identified in the strategy, whose outcome will be quality performance in these key areas against international standards to be reflected in the detailed action plan to be prepared under this grant.</narrative>
  </description>
